window.products.push({"id":173081,"name":"Great Bay Home Bed Linen Set, 4 Piece, Extra Soft Velvet Plush Queen Micro Fleece Sheet Set, Deluxe Microplush Non Pilling Sheets, Deep Pocket, Lavish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CXLxpAVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our premium velvet luxe bed sheets enhance the comfort level of any bed. Each set includes 1 microplush fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet, and 2 pillowcases (1 pillowcase for Twin sheet set). We have tons of lavish patterns and colors available for Twin size sheets, Full size sheets, Queen size sheets, King size sheets, and even California King size sheets. Lavish Sherpa Sheets: Super soft, lightweight, and breathable! Feel the difference in our 180 GSM 100% microfleece sheets. These velvet plush sheets are the most luxurious sheets you'll ever own! They are soft, cozy, and, breathable. Stay warm and toasty on the coldest nights of winter and sleep better than ever. These microplush sheets are available in an abundance of solid colors and prints. We even offer a variety of printed holiday sheets perfect for this holiday season. Perfect Fit Every Time: The pocket size of these velvet sheets fits 14 mattresses for Full, Queen, King & California King and 12 mattresses for Twin. They are easy to care for and easy to wash. These microplush sheets are machine washable, wrinkle resistant, fade resistant, shrink resistant & pill resistant. These non pilling lavish sherpa sheets are just what you need this winter! 1 Year Warranty: We want you to love your home and the furnishings you invest in for a long time to come, so we design our products to work for you as long as you need them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CXLxpAVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Bay Home","source_asin":"B0BFRLT5WP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFRLT5WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFRLT5WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173082,"name":"ANDMOON Bento Lunch Box, 5 Compartments Lunch Container for Kids & Adults with Snack cup, Wheat Fiber Eco-Friendly Double Insulated Boxes, Dishwasher ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fKrsjL6iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design: This compact self-contained lunch box has 5 perfectly allocated compartments, as well as a 2oz snack cup and a set of cutlery. We understand that your lunch may be carrying different kinds of food, so separation design is really important. Not only controls your portion sizes, but also ensures balanced meals based on appetite and overall nutrition. Get creative with your meal! Material & Environmental Protection: ANDMOON uses the most environmentally friendly wheat fiber material, which is healthy and durable. The equipped snack cup is made of stainless steel and the lid is made of silicone. The wheat fiber material also degrades on its own, a more earth-friendly alternative to plastic that helps reduce single-use plastic waste! Advocating green and healthy life, starting from you and me. Warm & Microwave: This lunchbox container consists of a double insulated box. It uses thickened material to make it stronger and warmer than ordinary lunch boxes. Its bottom tray is microwaveable, making it ideal for hot and cold meals. Remove the cover before heating in the microwave! Leak-Proof & Easy to Clean: The ANDMOON food storage container elastic sealing ring and snap lid work well together to form an air-tight and leak-proof seal, so you don't have to worry about food spills during travel. This portable lunch box is not only small and portable, the size is only 8.6*7.1*2.8 inches. The entire set, including the utensils, is dishwasher safe and it is very easy to clean. Going Out: This bento box is very friendly to dining out, an office worker or a picnic, it can easily pack delicious, healthy lunches and snacks. It can keep the food fresh and keep the original taste of the food. It is very suitable for adults or people aged 3-12, and you can easily open it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fKrsjL6iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANDMOON","source_asin":"B0BQJQHQGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQJQHQGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQJQHQGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
