window.products.push({"id":173087,"name":"Moolan Cordless Vacuum Cleaner,380W Stick Vacuum with 28Kpa Suction,6-in-1 Rechargeable Vacuum,45mins Max,Lightweight Bagless Vacuum with LED Headligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6l6k7lQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【28000Pa Powerful Suction & Powerful Motor】380W full copper with 80000rpm motor provides up to 28Kpa strong suction, ideal for household cleaning dirt, dust, debris, dander, plenty of pet hair and fur, no matter on carpet, hardwood, tile or cement floor. 【99.99% 5-Layer Efficiency Filtration Vacuum】Moolan cordless vacuum cleaner has 5 filters inside to purify the air. The 5-layer filtration keeps airbome particles with a size from 0.2 to 10 microns (μm) can not escape and stays in the dust box，2 high quality replaceable washable HEPA filter, instead of the cheap suction effect of poor spongefilter, Filtration efficiency can be increased by 200%,so you can really use the peace of mind 【Superior Detachable & Rechargeable Battery】6*2200mAh large battery capacity offers runtime of 30-40mins in turbo mode,45-50mins in normal mode. Detachable and rechargeable battery supports two charging methods, Placing the whole machine to charge or the battery is removed separately to charge, repeatedly taking into account your use scenario and charging convenience to use for vacuuming. 【180° Rotate Floor Brush & Foldable Tube】With high-density upgraded V-shaped fluff roller brush, led light floor brush and fordable tube, The brush head can be rotated 180 degrees left and right, 90 degrees front and back, and the folding tube can form a maximum angle of 45 degrees,That make the vacuum is more convenient to clean garbage, dirt, dust, debris, pet hair and fur, even in dark & hard- to-reach area. 【Lightweight Quiet Handheld&Stick Vacuum】Only weighting 2.95lbs, great for elders and adults to clean the curtain, high floor windows,stairs and ceiling. Low noise,no worries to use even children and pets is sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6l6k7lQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moolan","source_asin":"B0BMFHRW78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMFHRW78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMFHRW78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
