window.products.push({"id":173105,"name":"JSWF Premium Bed Pillows for Sleeping Queen Size Standard Pillows Set of 2Pack Alternative Filling Soft Gusseted Pillow for Side Stomach Back Sleepers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81utlt7G4OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMFY FABRIC: The pillow cover is made of high-density microfiber fabric. Unique softening technology makes the quality fabric more soft and smooth. This cooling and comfortable fabric allows your skin to breathe when it touches the pillow. PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: Each queen size pillow measures 20 x 26 inches. Our set of 2 pillows are compressed in vacuum bags for shipping, It will be a little flat when you first receive it. Please leave 24 hours for the pillow to get to full-thickness before using it. SUPPORTIVE COMFORT: The fluffy pillows with 1100gsm 7D microfiber filling, which conform to the natural curves of your body and provide overall gentle support and adequate comfort to your head, neck, and shoulders. ELABORATE DESIGN: We use ultrasonic three-dimensional embossing technology to create a lot of delicate little squares on the surface and match it with double stitching piping on the edges to protect the edge of the pillow from being worn. An Elegant appearance with a fluffy texture will greatly improve your sleep quality. OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED：JSZS pillows 7D microfiber filling is certified by OEKO-TEX standard 100%. We control the quality of every process of production and provide you with the safest products. Making a tentative purchase and you will find they are worth your trust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81utlt7G4OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSWF","source_asin":"B0B7JC696W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7JC696W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7JC696W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173106,"name":"Nuwave Smart Air Purifier for Home Large Room up to 1,200 Sq. Ft, Auto Function Monitors Air Quality & Adjusts 6 Fan Speeds 5-Stage Filtration System ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":643.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GEI+-tB0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFECTIVE FOR EXTRA LARGE ROOM UP TO 1,200 SQ. FT. - The U.S. EPA estimates that the air in your home can have as much as 5 TIMES MORE pollutants than outdoors. Although the air may look clean to the naked eye, you could be unknowingly inhaling harmful air. OxyPure is proven to effectively purify the air up to 1,200 sq. ft. with 2 air exchanges per hour. SMART TECHNOLOGY BUILT-IN – Auto function utilizes particle & odor sensors to continuously monitor air quality in the room and automatically adjusts fan speeds for optimal purification. Turbo function operates at max speed for up to 2 hours for rapid purification. 6 fan speeds from low to high can be selected for up to 12 hours. Connect remotely to monitor and control the air quality in your home anytime, anywhere from an app on your phone. REVOLUTIONARY 5-LAYER PROTECTION – The revolutionary Bio-Guard Filter and Stainless Steel Pre-Filter, washable & reusable up to 20 years. Ozone Emission Removal Filter reusable up to 20 years. Includes 8 HEPA/Carbon Combo Filter. ALLERGY RELIEF & BETTER SLEEP – The National Sleep Foundation found that sleep is dramatically impaired by poor air quality and worse the symptoms, the more severe the disturbances. OxyPure promotes better sleep by eliminating and purifying the air that can irritate the sinuses, nasal passages, and lungs. OxyPure is designed with Night Time mode. All indicator lights turn off and fan operates at whisper-quiet level at 31.4 dB to help promote ideal sleeping conditions. INDEPENDENT 3RD PARTY LAB CERTIFIED - California Air Resource Board (CARB) certified, and UL tested and validated. Intertek tested. EPA Energy Star certified – the OxyPure can operate all year long with less than $10 in annual electricity costs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GEI+-tB0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B08RR58FSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RR58FSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RR58FSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173107,"name":"MONOKIT Super Powerful Vacuum Suction Cup Shower Soap Dish - Strong Rustproof Stainless Steel Soap Saver Sponge Holder for Bathroom & Kitchen Sink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jG8EkJRVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Installation steps: 1. Ensure the surface is flat and smooth. Use a dry cloth to clean the surface and the suction cup. 2. Loosen the knob and take off the knob and cup. 3. Place the suction cup against the surface. Avoid placing the suction cup over the tile grouting or other surface joins or gaps. 4. Press the center of the suction-cup firmly and ensure any air between the suction cup and the surface is removed. 5. Rotate the knob clockwise to lock until fully tight. 6. How to remove: simply follow the above steps in reverse. Pull the suction cup \"small ear\", let it inject air, then rotate it counterclockwise, the suction cup will be removed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jG8EkJRVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MONOKIT","source_asin":"B093F56SS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093F56SS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093F56SS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
