window.products.push({"id":173117,"name":"Threadmill Home Linen Queen Pillowcases - Certified 100% Egyptian Cotton 2 Piece Pillow Cover Set, 400 Thread Count Sateen Weave, Comfortable ELS Comb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OY9uXwSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AUTHENTIC EGYPTIAN COTTON PILLOW COVERS FOR COZY AND HEALTHY SLEEP: Bid adieu to sleepless nights by adding our soft and smooth 400 thread count pillowcases to your bedding collection. Crafted with authentic extra long staple Egyptian cotton yarns, these opulent pillow covers have the accredited golden seal of authenticity, unlike unauthentic Egyptian cotton covers in the market. Their signature sateen weave provides remarkable comfort and durability, making them completely worth the price. QUEEN SIZE PILLOWCASE SET TO PERFECTLY COVER YOUR PILLOWS: Sleep peacefully by keeping night sweats at bay with our cooling and lightweight 400 thread count pillow covers. Each queen size set contains 2 pillowcases measuring 20\" W x 30\" L. Designed to snugly fit your fluffy pillows, these pillow covers are generously sized to prevent the pillow inserts from popping out. EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY, MACHINE WASHABLE CASES AT AN UNBEATABLE PRICE: Made with the highest quality materials and craftsmanship, our elegant pillow covers are worth every penny. Each pillowcase is expertly woven to ensure pill-resistance, fade-resistance, and long-lasting strength. Our premium pillow covers get softer and retain color with every wash. To avoid shrinkage and wrinkles, machine wash the cases at room temperature, tumble dry on low and fold them neatly right after. ACCENTUATE YOUR BED LINEN COLLECTION & BEDROOM DECOR WITH ELEGANCE: Our glorious Egyptian cotton range is meant for the ultimate bedroom experience. Whether it is adding a touch of pastel luxury to your room or contrasting your bed linen with a pop of color, these classy pillow covers are all you need. Along with their divine colors, these pillow protector sets bring with them superior comfort to wash all your tiredness away. CERTIFIED & SUSTAINABLE PRACTICES WITH 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We take pride in making some of the world’s finest linens while respecting the environment. Our products and practices are free from harmful chemicals, earning the OEKO TEX certification. All these premium pillow covers are manufactured in wind and solar energy powered factory. They are packed in a zero plastic, reusable cotton tote bag and delivered with a 100% satisfaction guarantee, giving you exceptional customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OY9uXwSvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Threadmill","source_asin":"B0BN95NVNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN95NVNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN95NVNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
