window.products.push({"id":173175,"name":"Memorial Keepsake Jar by \"Wings Around Me\" A place to keep all your Angelic Feathers and Pennies from Heaven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xznJyD7yL._SL1333_.jpg","description":"Introducing our extraordinary creation, the Spiritual \"Wings Around Me Keepsake Jar,\" where you can uncover enchantment and profound meaning within every word. Inspired by a heartfelt poem that beautifully captured the essence of serendipity and love, this unique item encapsulates the sheer beauty when a humble penny and a delicate feather intertwine. With meticulous craftsmanship, the \"Wings Around Me Keepsake Jar\" becomes a tangible representation of the extraordinary bond between these two ethereal elements. Each piece showcases an authentic, brilliantly polished penny, symbolizing the often overlooked treasures that hold deep significance in our lives. Yet, what truly sets this product apart is the inclusion of a genuine feather, delicately placed alongside the penny. This is no ordinary feather—it exudes grace and allure, carrying with it a remarkable story. Like the gentle embrace of angelic wings, it serves as a tangible reminder of love's embrace and a symbol of devotion that resonates with the depths of our souls. With the Wings Around Me Keepsake Jar, you possess a profound reminder of destiny's mysterious ways. It opens the gateway to cherished memories and extends an invitation to reflect upon the extraordinary connections that shape our lives. Personalization is available for each jar, allowing you to display the name, birth year, and passing year of your lost loved one. This poetic keepsake transcends being merely an item—it becomes a gateway to memories, beckoning you to reflect upon the remarkable connections that have shaped your journey. Order your Wings Around Me Keepsake Jar today and embark on collecting those pennies from heaven and angelic feathers, which symbolize protection, love, and divine connection. Let this timeless treasure become a cherished part of your story.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xznJyD7yL._SL1333_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wings Around Me","source_asin":"B07NH4HDTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NH4HDTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NH4HDTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173176,"name":"softan Christmas Sherpa Fleece Blanket - Christmas Printed Plush Furry Blanket for Couch Bed Fuzzy Fur Blanket - 60x80 inches Twin - Royal Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A85c5CkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exceedingly soft experience: softan double-sided throw blanket with smooth velvet fleece face and plush sherpa reverse will bring you unprecedented skin touching experience - unlike cotton fabric, you will enjoy rubbing face against this royal blue printed sherpa blanket when sleepping on bed or napping on couch. Smooth silky flannel side plus fluffy cloud-like sherpa no-shedding design also makes this fleece blanket an affection to pets Premium material: This sherpa fur blanket crafts from high quality 100% microfiber polyester, featuring winkle and fade resistant, no pilling, quick-drying. Meanwhile, the fleece throw blanket holds shape much longer than cotton blanket as we only select premium microfiber polyester - naturally with much better elasticity than cotton. All flannel blankets are backed up with 2 years’ manufacture warranty and 30 days no reason return guarantee A chic decoration: the royal blue printed throw fleece blanket is designed for luxurious feel and elegance, you can drape flannel fur blanket over a chair, couch or bed to add an exotic stylish touch to your living room or bedroom Versatile usage: Snuggle up on your couch with softan plush and warm sherpa fleece blankets when spending times watching TV shows with family or just enjoy a cup of coffee reading alone on a chilly day. royal blue printed throw blanket is ideal for indoor and outdoor use - provide consecutive warmth in camping, picnics, travels. Flannel fur blanket is a reat choice as gifts for Men and Women, Dads and Moms, Valentines, Mother's Day, Father’s Day and Christmas Machine Washable: Machine wash royal blue printed throw blanket on gentle cycle with cold water, tumble dry at very low temperature. This all season sherpa throw blanket holds its shape and color after several machine washes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A85c5CkcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"softan","source_asin":"B0894J9W7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894J9W7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894J9W7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
