window.products.push({"id":173189,"name":"shuoguoleilei Chinese Hand Hammered Iron Woks Set, Non-stick No Coating Preseasoned Wok Blue Round Bottom Wok Pan For Electric, Induction and Gas Stov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yxQE351VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Chinese wok, made in China. Our wok goes through 12 processes and 36,000 hand hammers. It shines like a mirror. You can see all the hammer lines but barely feel them. The mirror surface allows the ingredients to slide smoothly in the pot. 2. The surface of this non-stick blue carbon steel pan is specially treated to bond with oil faster. Remember, there are no acidic/alkaline foods, dry them after each use, this pan will work its magic time and time again! 3. This wok is uncoated and unpainted. Don't worry about peeling off the non-stick coating, iron is reactive and will form a protective layer of iron oxide. The longer you use it, the less sticky it becomes. 4. With good thermal conductivity, it can directly transmit the temperature of the fire to the food, ensuring your food is nutritious and delicious, saving you more gas and time. The small amount of beneficial iron dissolved in the wok provides the iron the body needs and is easily absorbed. 5. If you have any questions or dissatisfaction, please feel free to contact us, we will deal with this problem as soon as possible. If you like our products, please click the \"Add to Cart\" button now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yxQE351VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"shuoguoleilei","source_asin":"B0B462D2FJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B462D2FJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B462D2FJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173190,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Garden of Eden 15-Ounce Mugs, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H38MK63SL._AC_.jpg","description":"Garden of Eden is an intriguing pattern that combines artful foliage colorations of blues, greens and just a hint of red with subtle textural details to enliven a table setting with a taste of the Orient. Simple yet elegant sprays of leaves adorn plates, mugs and serving pieces embossed with radiating lines that evoke the natural peace of a quiet garden retreat. Everyone loves a mug! It's one of our most popular items. All the handles on our mugs are made separately to stay cool, even after you reheat your beverage in the microwave. 15 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H38MK63SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000KDUR50","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000KDUR50","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000KDUR50","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
