window.products.push({"id":173208,"name":"Cake Flour Burlap Bag by Marcee Duggar, 14x14-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NkrIVNI1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a blue and red logo on a burlap sack texture. I enjoy things that are old, worn, imperfect, rusty and peeling paint. My artwork reflects that love. I use lots of vintage imagery and blending of colors, shapes and textures in my art. All of my designs were created in photoshop. I love to make thing look real as possible. I want my art to reach out and grab you. I am also a great fan of fonts and typography and they way different fonts work together to create art. I am self taught and started on the very first digital scrapbooking site way back in 2004, creating artwork for scrapbookers and home crafters. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NkrIVNI1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B071Z9LQ43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071Z9LQ43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071Z9LQ43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
