window.products.push({"id":173251,"name":"Glass Ware Diamond Cut Pitcher with Lid & Handle (Lid is White) Use for All Drinks, Punch, Milk, Water, Tea, Coffee, Juices and More (1, 1 lt)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71defN-RjwL._AC_SL1132_.jpg","description":"All Purpose Elegant glass Jar/Pitcher, for Water, Juice, Milk, or Any other Beverage. The base of this Pitcher provides maximum stability. Perfect for refrigerator door. Ideal for Juice and all beverages as well. Breakthrough styling and unmatched brand value. Unique Glass shape enhances the Juices aromas and flavors. Preserves and presents flavor exactly as intended. Made of clear glass enabling the color of the beverage to shine. Elegant look in a wine cabinet and adds to any table's aesthetics with their contemporary design. Increase the overall drinking experience and is strongly recommended by experts around the globe.An old-fashioned lemonade stand look adds instant charm and vintage appeal to your setting. The textured, diamond glass design with easy-pour spout and handle is compact and versatile, slipping in the fridge to keep your favorite beverage chilled or standing out on the tabletop. Why choose a glass over plastic? It allows you to sip colder and more pure-tasting water, looks sleek and elegant, and is thicker and sturdier than plastic. Glass is also better for the planet: made from all-natural, sustainable raw materials, glass is 100% recyclable and can be reused endlessly. A perfect gift too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71defN-RjwL._AC_SL1132_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Products Essentials","source_asin":"B07SNHK3WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SNHK3WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SNHK3WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173252,"name":"Topeakmart Office Chair Desk Chair Mesh Computer Desk Chair with Wheels Ergonomic Office Chair Height Adjustable Swivel Task Chair with Mid Back, Flip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91y29GsLRaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ergonomically Designed Desk Chair】Ergonomic features such as the S-shaped back, retractable armrests, moveable lumbar pillow as well as a 4 inch adjustable range of seat height provide customized comfort during long periods of work, study or other activities. 【90° Flip-up Armrests】Want to scoot as closely as to the desk? Flip the arms up, and you’ll gain all the benefits of an armless desk chair, including a larger sitting area, saving floor space in a small room and more. 【Cushioned Seat & Mesh Back】This home office chair features a generous seat that measures 19.7’’(W) x 19.7’’ (D) and is padded with high-density foam, offering substantial cushy support and relieving fatigue from hours of sitting. Plus, the mid-height backrest wrapped with breathable mesh allows air, body heat, and moisture to freely pass through, helping you maintain a comfortable temperature. 【Simple Seat Height Adjustment】With the adjustment lever, the seat height can be easily shifted between 17.7 and 21.7 inches to accommodate different workstation heights, while also allowing your feet to firmly touch the floor when seated. This ergonomic office chair also has a rocking function for relaxation during breaks. 【Clear Instructions】All the hardware, connection parts and handy tools are provided in the package of this computer desk chair. A detailed step-by-step illustration of assembling procedure is shown in the instruction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91y29GsLRaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topeakmart","source_asin":"B0C2BXPJCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2BXPJCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2BXPJCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173253,"name":"LinenZone Damask Embossed Blue Teal Extra Wide Curtain Panels Used As Curtains for Patio Doors, Sliding Glass Door Curtain, Curtain Room Dividers, or ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vcpJGoMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🟢 USE OUR EXTRA WIDE BLACKOUT CURTAINS ANYWHERE - LinenZone 102 Inches Wide x 84 Inches Long, Extra Large Window Curtains Can Be Used Throughout Home. Blue Teal Patio Door Curtain is a Perfect Substitute for Sliding Glass Door Blinds or Vertical Blinds for Sliding Doors. Our Extra Wide Curtain Panels Can Cover Large Windows, Function as Kitchen Curtains for Patio Doors, Bedroom Closet Curtain, Sliding Hanging Room Dividers, Back Door Curtains or Even Replace Accordion Doors. 🟢 STYLISH LIGHT BLOCKING CURTAINS FOR MOST DECORS - If You Tired of Boring Looking Blackout Window Curtains Panels, Then Our Damask Design Embossed Blackout Curtains for Bedroom are Exactly What You are Looking For. Our Room Darkening Curtains are Soft to the Touch and Can Be Used in Rooms Decorated for French Country Curtains, Shabby Chic Curtains, Modern Farmhouse Curtains, Vintage Curtains, Mid Century Modern Curtains or Rustic Curtains. 🟢 NOISE REDUCTION CURTAINS FOR ANY ROOM - Our Elegant Blackout Curtaines Are Not Just For Bedroom. These Floral Curtains Are Perfect Sound Absorbing Curtains and Can Be Used As Living Room Curtains, Nursery Blackout Curtains, Curtains for Boys Room, Girls Room Curtains, Kids Blackout Curtains, Dining Room Curtains, Small Window Curtains, Basement or Even Balcony Curtains. 🟢 VARIETY OF SIZES AND COLORS - Our Window Coverings Set Designed to Block Between 90% and 96% of the Sun Light. Privacy Curtains Come in 6 Colors (Charcoal Gray, Ivory Beige, Silver Grey, Navy Blue, Brown Taupe and Teal) so You Can Definitely Find Modern Black Out Shades that Fit Your Bedroom Decor. We Offer Curtain Pairs, Individual Window Curtain Panels, Sunblock Patio Door Curtains and Extra Wide, Extra Long Room Dividers So You Can Always Find What You Are Looking For. 🟢 CLEAN AND MAINTAIN WITH EASE: LinenZone Cortinas Blackout Can Be Hanged Straight From the Package and Most Wrinkles Will Be Gone Within a Week. Curtians Can Be Washed In Washing Machine in Cold Water with a Mild Detergent. Our No Fuss Curtins Can Be Dried in Dryer on Low Heat Settings. If All Wrinkles Do Disappear, Low Heat Steam Dryer Can Be Applied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vcpJGoMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LinenZone","source_asin":"B09K4JPW7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K4JPW7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K4JPW7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
