window.products.push({"id":173425,"name":"Threadmill Luxury 100% Cotton Bath Towels Set of 4-600 GSM 30\" x 54\" Folkstone Blue Ultra Soft, Quick Dry & Super Absorbent Bath Towels - Premium Hote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GX4NN9dtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFTNESS & COMFORT OF 100% PURE COTTON IN THE ULTIMATE 4 PACK: Introducing our all new Towels Set pack of 4 Bathroom Bath Towels (30 inch x 54 inch) 600 GSM Zero Twist with paramount softness & comfort. Have a complete lint free experience with high absorbency & quick drying power of these incomparable cotton towels. So dive carefree into the cozy & pamper your skin like no one else. SKIN FRIENDLY & DURABLE ZERO TWIST TOWELS: Our Towels use longer and stronger cotton fibers, looped through the towel base instead of being twisted out from the towel. This enables you to feel the smooth loops when drying off rather than many short stubby twists, making them perfect for sensitive skin without the loops irritating you. These skin friendly towels are not only as soft as clouds but also last longer than your imagination with an incomparable durability & long-lasting hue. FEEL HOTEL-LIKE LUXURY IN EVERY TOUCH OF OUR PREMIUM QUALITY TOWELS: Exquisitely crafted with the top-notch material, our 100% pure Cotton Towels provide you with a Hotel-like comfort at home. The soft and luxurious touch of these super absorbent bath towels redefine freshness for you. Made with the finest and longest fibers are thick but light enough to wrap up and relax for hours. With enhanced absorbency & higher GSM, these towels are a perfect example of elegance & sophistication. EASY TO CARE TOWELS FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE: Woven carefully with high quality material and the best techniques, our towels are not only soft and durable but also fade resistant and quick drying, making them long-lasting & easy to care for. We recommend washing the towel sets before first use to make them fluffier. Machine wash them with warm water & like colours to prevent bleeding. Avoid bleach or fabric softeners for fade resistance. Tumble dry low and fold them neatly after drying. CERTIFIED & SUSTAINABLE PRACTICES WITH 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We provide you with the world’s finest skin friendly Towel Sets, free from harmful chemicals, earning the OEKO TEX certification. All premium Shower Towels are manufactured in wind & solar energy powered factories. Meeting high safety & environmental standards, our independently tested Bath Towel Sets ensure quality comfort & Wellness. Our exceptional customer service & practices make us the best choice for you and the planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GX4NN9dtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Threadmill","source_asin":"B09NV1C3CL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NV1C3CL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NV1C3CL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
