window.products.push({"id":173589,"name":"Hillyard Cowhide Rug Premium Black and White Real Handcrafted Grade A Natural Cowhide Rug - Sustainably Sourced and Lasts Longer Black and White Extra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":192.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rxFykVUuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Grade A, Real Black and White Cowhide: The Hillyard Black and White Cowhide Rug is a real cowhide rug handcrafted by artisanal crafters that have been graded A for premium quality and high craftsmanship. It is a unique and modern piece that will add vibrancy to any decor scheme. The high contrast of black against white makes this an ideal choice for anyone looking for a cool and contemporary look in their home. Sustainably Sourced and Handcrafted: This black and white cowhide rug has been ethically sourced from sustainable origins in Argentina with care for both animals and master craftsmen artisans alike. Our rugs are crafted of the highest quality natural cowhide making it uber durable and long-lasting, and all sustainably sourced to support communities and the environment. Note that colors may vary due to the natural nature of our rugs. Deep Blacks and Bright Whites: The colors on this Black and White Cowhide Rug are incredibly vibrant with high contrast between the black and white tones, making it the perfect addition to any modern or contemporary space, and its handcrafted nature ensures that no two are alike, making each one a true work of art. The hair on the hide is soft to the touch and feels great under your feet or toes, and would be perfect as an area rug in a kitchen or living room or as a bedroom decor piece. A One of a Kind Piece: This extra-large cut of the cowhide rug may vary in size from approximately 7.5 feet by 6.5 feet, and the square footage is between 32-43 feet. It features a unique pattern, ensuring that each piece is one-of-a-kind. This cowhide rug is perfect for adding a touch of rustic charm to your home décor. It elevates any space, whether small or large, and its beauty can hold its own as its centerpiece. The Hillyard Quality You Can Trust:All Hillyard cowhide and skins have been sustainably sourced from Argentina, where the hides are hand-selected for their quality and beauty. It is made by skilled artisans using traditional methods, resulting in a unique and eye-catching piece that will add character to any space. This exceptional cowhide is soft to the touch and easy to clean, making it perfect for use in high traffic areas such as the kitchen, living room, and large offices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rxFykVUuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hillyard","source_asin":"B09VRQB9NR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VRQB9NR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VRQB9NR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
