window.products.push({"id":173685,"name":"Custom Towel Set of 2, Monogrammed Hand Towels , Personalized Hand Towels with Names, 100% Cotton Luxury Embroidered Hand Towels for Personalized Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZMW9WeGKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【CUSTOM HAND TOWEL WITH NAME 】With the embroidered your name /initials A-Z monogram towel, perfect for use as a personalized gift. Also great for general home decor or bathroom use. 【PERSONALIZED GIFT】Embroidered hand towels make a wonderful gift for any occasion, such as birthday gifts, Christmas gifts, anniversary, baby shower, bridal shower, wedding, Thanksgiving, beach, kitchen, bathroom, living room, etc. Personalized monogram towels will make an excellent choice to give as gifts to a friend or a loved one. 【QUALITY EMBROIDERY CRAFT】Monogram hand towels are made of 100% Cotton. The terry fabric is incredibly, soft to the touch, offers maximum absorbency as well as being quick drying, low linting properties for a longer life. Exquisite embroidery craftsmanshipl creating a luxurious hotel & Spa feel in your bathroom. 【EMBROIDERED TOWELS PERSONALIZED】 This monogram hand towels set including 2 Hand Towels (13.5\" x 29.5\" inches). Custom monogrammed towels with names help you find the corresponding towel easily, very suitable for the bathroom or toilet. Say goodbye to your drab old hand towels and add more class to your wash or kitchen with these personalized bath towels. 【WASHING INSTRUCTIONS】Easy to care and use, machine washable and effortless cleaning. Embroidered hand towels for bathroom with elegant appearance and practicality, ideal for everyday use. Embroidered towels personalized is a quick and easy way to refresh your bathroom's decoration, click 'Customize Now' to instantly transform your bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZMW9WeGKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEDULEKA","source_asin":"B09PH3DNZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PH3DNZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PH3DNZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173686,"name":"Spider-Man 'Toon Tumbler Pint Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71USDw6p9fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here's a clear Pint Glass featuring Spiderman illustrated by the venerable John Romita Senior! Spider-Man crouches in front of a white web, a little less emotionally sound since he just realized Aunt May is still alive and Mary Jane is nowhere to be found. Spiderman should have learned this lesson as well: With great power comes great lapses in logical decision-making! NOT DISHWASHER SAFE: These glasses are works of art. Though durable for normal use, they cannot stand up to the ridiculously high temperatures and harsh detergents in your dishwasher. Your dishwasher will fade and tarnish these highly sought-after images, ruining your glass! Instead, HAND WASH these comic, glass artifacts with some soap and common sense, i.e., don't take a friggin' scouring brush to the paint. Proposition 65 notice for California residents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71USDw6p9fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Other Manufacturer","source_asin":"B002VZWHF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002VZWHF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002VZWHF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":173687,"name":"AOOE Red Wine Glasses Set of 4, Hand Blown Crystal Glasses-21 OZ,Large Burgundy Glasses- Light, Clear, Ultra-thin, Best for Wine tasting, Christmas, A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A+4vUKniL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍷【Exclusive Craftsmanship Hand Blown】ROVSYA red wine glasses are exquisitely crafted. This means that each special product is individually mouth blown and hand-finished in 5 mins by skilled artisans. Hand-blown crystal wine glasses are generally lighter, thinner, and more graceful than machine-made ones. 🍷【Perfect Wine Pairing - Wine Aerator】 When you choose ROVSYA red wine glasses, we will give you a set of wine aerator, which is a huge time saver for serving red wine, infusing your wine with the best oxygen, with a red wine glass you can taste the nuances of the wine. Cheers and happy sipping! 🍷【Elegant Crystal Glasses Refracts Sparkly Light】By eliminating lead content from the crystal glass composition, our glasses are replaced with fine Titanium crystal and a patented chemical formulation that produces ultra clear, pure, and bright glass. Lead-Free Premium crystal glasses also refract light, which is quite desirable when ogling your wine. They should please even the most discerning connoisseur. 🍷【Beautiful Sound Resonates】The beautiful sound resonates that is like a distant church bell... when you flick or clink a piece of crystal. Tap the piece gently along the rim with your fingernail, if the piece is real crystal, it will ring out with a pleasant tone. But glass emits more of a noise sound. 🍷【Allowing for the Purest Wine Tasting Experience】Choose a large burgundy glass that will allow the wine to perform its best. These thin red wine glasses do look like the type of glasses you’d expect to see if you were dinner party with a renowned connoisseur. larger bowls are finished with 1mm smooth rims and pulled stems for an effortlessly elegant. Thanks to a design that’s shaped to perfectly aerate your favorite red while keeping its delicate and intoxicating aroma in the glass. 🍷【Hassle-free Cleaning】Our set of 4 wine glasses is capable of being spun thin while maintaining strength. Because crystal is a porous material, it's best to hand wash. Elegant crystal wine glasses are the most high-end option, keeping them scratch-free is a priority. Ideally, you want to hand wash to extend their lifespan and always for good taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A+4vUKniL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOOE","source_asin":"B0BS2CVGV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS2CVGV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS2CVGV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
