window.products.push({"id":173760,"name":"Legigo Set of 12 Christmas Wreath Napkin Rings Set- Metal Xmas Napkin Ring Holders for Cloth Napkins, Christmas Holiday Party Dinner Table Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c4q4FrGsL._AC_SL1236_.jpg","description":"【Elegant Pretty Napkin Rings】You will get 12pcs napkin ring holder, classic wreath design, simple and elegant, delicate and romantic, exquisite rhinestones sparkle under the light, classic wreath design is very suitable for Christmas-themed dinner parties, it is also suitable for families dinner, friends gathering. And decorating your favorite napkins at the same time give you a beautiful feeling. 【Standard Napkin Rings Size】The diameter of the ring is 1.7 inches, which suits most cloth napkins, towels, bouquet. You can design the napkins with different styles, then decorate them with elegant napkin rings. 【Sturdy & Pretty Material】These rings brackets are made of zinc alloy which are durable and sturdy. Accurate cutting, they won't hurt the napkin to ensure its perfect. For the christmas wreath pattern which is made of eye-catching rhinestone, perfect cutting make it more stunning, sparkling under the light. 【Easy to Clean & Reusable】If the napkin ring is dirty, you can wipe the napkin ring with a wet sponge or wet cloth, then dry it with a soft dry cloth, it will a new one and glisten under the light. When the dinner is over, you can clean it and save it for the next time using. And it’s also a decoration to put in your home. 【Multi-occasions application】Delicate napkin rings are suitable for Christmas party, wedding reception, Valentine's party, wedding anniversary, also daily dinner. They are gorgeous, vibrant, elegant, festive, sparkling, charming, stunning and adorable, they are perfect compliment to dinners' table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c4q4FrGsL._AC_SL1236_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Legigo","source_asin":"B0BDKFYXSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDKFYXSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDKFYXSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
