window.products.push({"id":173845,"name":"Anyfish 8 Inch Frying Pan without Lid Nonstick Induction Skillet Small Omelette Pan Beige Granite","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GqXTnIzYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safe Material & Nonstick】The nonstick frying pan made of durable, non-toxic food grade aluminum and nonstick granite coating, which is free of PFAS, PFOA, lead, and cadmium. Because of its good nonstick performance, so clean up is easy, only using a soft sponge or dishcloth, you can clear oil stain easily. Besides you can cook with little oil for healthy diet. 【Suitable For ALL Heat Sources】The induction frying pan adopts grade aluminum alloy with a magnetic flat bottom that conducts heat quickly and evenly and no hot spot, which also reduce the generation of cooking fumes. The skillet is perfectly suitable for gas, ceramic, electric, halogen or induction stoves. Oven and dishwasher are not applicable for the nonstick coating. 【Heat Resistant Handle & Glass Lid】The ergonomic bakelite handle are suitable for grasping and staying cooling while cooking. The connection of handle and pan body is reinforced with solid rivets that is not shown on pan surface, so it doesn’t affect cleaning. A hole on handle allows the frying pan to hang on the rack or wall. The see through glass lid allows you to check cooking progress while locking in flavor. 【Unique Design】 The pan surface is flat, so food and oil don't run off to the sides; There is a gap between handle and pan body that handle doesn’t discolor when near heat; 5 mm thicken induction compatible bottom provides a stable heat distribution during cooking, rapidly heating up, saves time and energy; 5mm thicken rim design provides heat storage and easy to pour. 【High Quality & After-Sale Service】Anyfish frying pan equipped with the thick die-casting aluminum construction, and 100% passed the quality tests before they leave the factory. If you receive this nonstick frying pan with any damage, please feel free to contact our service team directly for any questions. We will contact with you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GqXTnIzYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anyfish","source_asin":"B0B12JWHF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-173845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B12JWHF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B12JWHF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
